  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.6\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- Rename to Zafiro.MasterSystem.Debug (#4) (`40bcd1e`)\n- perf: make the run loop pay only for what is observed (#3) (`3da70ab`)\n- fix: set ContentRootPath to AppContext.BaseDirectory to avoid recursive inotify watches (`b0f8947`)\n- build: publish the emulator and core as NuGet libraries (#1) (`b4702ab`)\n- build: publish Sms.Mcp to NuGet with DotnetDeployer (`b834816`)\n- feat: fully managed Sega Master System / Game Gear debugging MCP (`f0bc350`)\n",
